{"id":"8349bf0f770c2db3","group":"58","path":"58/batch10/58-thm-schreier.md","title":"Nielsen–Schreier Theorem","display":"thm-schreier — Nielsen–Schreier Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-schreier","aliases":["58-thm-schreier","Nielsen–Schreier Theorem"],"display":"thm-schreier — Nielsen–Schreier Theorem","depends_on":["[[../batch09/58-df-group.md]]","[[../batch02/58-df-subgroup.md]]","[[../batch09/58-df-homomorphism.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-schreier"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-schreier</span><span>Nielsen–Schreier Theorem</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-schreier — Nielsen–Schreier Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ed71f39f59370734\" href=\"?note=ed71f39f59370734\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-group.md\">../batch09/58-df-group.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"59685d062adf2748\" href=\"?note=59685d062adf2748\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-subgroup.md\">../batch02/58-df-subgroup.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f32a973b59a825e4\" href=\"?note=f32a973b59a825e4\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-homomorphism.md\">../batch09/58-df-homomorphism.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F,H,B,C,\\cdot,i,j\\in V\">\\(F,H,B,C,\\cdot,i,j\\in V\\)</span>; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H\">\\(H\\)</span> carries <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\cdot_H=\\cdot\\upharpoonright(H\\times H)\">\\(\\cdot_H=\\cdot\\upharpoonright(H\\times H)\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Group}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Group}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Subgroup}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Subgroup}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GroupHomomorphism}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{GroupHomomorphism}_S\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> are the exact predicates from the dependencies.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FreeBasis}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{FreeBasis}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span> is defined here by the universal mapping property.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}free\\text{-}basis}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{FreeBasis}_S(B;F,\\cdot,i)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Group}_S(F,\\cdot)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(i,B,F)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall b,b&#39;\\in B\\;(i(b)=i(b&#39;)\\to b=b&#39;)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall K,\\star\\in V\\;\n\\left(\\mathrm{Group}_S(K,\\star)\\to\n\\forall f\\in K^B\\;\\exists!\\bar f\\in V\\;\n\\left[\n\\mathrm{GroupHomomorphism}_S(\\bar f,F,\\cdot,K,\\star)\n\\land\\bar f\\circ i=f\n\\right]\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}free\\text{-}basis}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{FreeBasis}_S(B;F,\\cdot,i)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Group}_S(F,\\cdot)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(i,B,F)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall b,b&#39;\\in B\\;(i(b)=i(b&#39;)\\to b=b&#39;)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall K,\\star\\in V\\;\n\\left(\\mathrm{Group}_S(K,\\star)\\to\n\\forall f\\in K^B\\;\\exists!\\bar f\\in V\\;\n\\left[\n\\mathrm{GroupHomomorphism}_S(\\bar f,F,\\cdot,K,\\star)\n\\land\\bar f\\circ i=f\n\\right]\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}schreier}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{FreeBasis}_S(B;F,\\cdot,i)\n\\land\\mathrm{Subgroup}_S(H,F,\\cdot)\n\\to\n\\left[\n\\exists C,j\\in V\\;\n\\mathrm{FreeBasis}_S\n(C;H,\\cdot\\upharpoonright(H\\times H),j)\n\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}schreier}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{FreeBasis}_S(B;F,\\cdot,i)\n\\land\\mathrm{Subgroup}_S(H,F,\\cdot)\n\\to\n\\left[\n\\exists C,j\\in V\\;\n\\mathrm{FreeBasis}_S\n(C;H,\\cdot\\upharpoonright(H\\times H),j)\n\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The ambient and subgroup free structures are expressed by the same explicit universal property; the inherited group operation is not hidden.</li>\n<li>If <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> has finite rank and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H\">\\(H\\)</span> has finite index, then <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{rank}(H)-1=[F:H](\\operatorname{rank}(F)-1)\">\\(\\operatorname{rank}(H)-1=[F:H](\\operatorname{rank}(F)-1)\\)</span>; that extra formula requires those finiteness hypotheses.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch09/58-df-group.md","status":"resolved","id":"ed71f39f59370734","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-group.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-subgroup.md","status":"resolved","id":"59685d062adf2748","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-subgroup.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-homomorphism.md","status":"resolved","id":"f32a973b59a825e4","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-homomorphism.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"F,H,B,C,\\cdot,i,j\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"H","display":false},{"tex":"\\cdot_H=\\cdot\\upharpoonright(H\\times H)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Group}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Subgroup}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GroupHomomorphism}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FreeBasis}_S\\subseteq V^4","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}free\\text{-}basis}\\vdash{}&\n\\mathrm{FreeBasis}_S(B;F,\\cdot,i)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Group}_S(F,\\cdot)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(i,B,F)\\\\\n&{}\\land\\forall b,b'\\in B\\;(i(b)=i(b')\\to b=b')\\\\\n&{}\\land\\forall K,\\star\\in V\\;\n\\left(\\mathrm{Group}_S(K,\\star)\\to\n\\forall f\\in K^B\\;\\exists!\\bar f\\in V\\;\n\\left[\n\\mathrm{GroupHomomorphism}_S(\\bar f,F,\\cdot,K,\\star)\n\\land\\bar f\\circ i=f\n\\right]\\right).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}schreier}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{FreeBasis}_S(B;F,\\cdot,i)\n\\land\\mathrm{Subgroup}_S(H,F,\\cdot)\n\\to\n\\left[\n\\exists C,j\\in V\\;\n\\mathrm{FreeBasis}_S\n(C;H,\\cdot\\upharpoonright(H\\times H),j)\n\\right].","display":true},{"tex":"F","display":false},{"tex":"H","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{rank}(H)-1=[F:H](\\operatorname{rank}(F)-1)","display":false}],"bytes":1746,"backlinks":[{"id":"fdc5783bcc51ac51","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4408","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-thm-schreier.md|58-thm-schreier]]（batch10）"}],"outgoing":["ed71f39f59370734","59685d062adf2748","f32a973b59a825e4","36d7463d215be751"]}